       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Total daily dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults in a hospital setting is 3,200 mg/day. This order is double that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** At this level the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events rises sharply, and the higher dose gives no added analgesic or anti-inflammatory benefit.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day), a common dose for mild to moderate pain.\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day).\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day), or **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the ceiling). Both are typical for inflammatory conditions.\n- **1600 mg total per day,** for example 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily. You may have meant this if the 1600 mg was the daily total.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you really do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give a clinical reason. I'd also suggest a pharmacist review before I enter it."
      }
